Subject: [PATCH 2/3] scratch: fsys5-after-seed43.patch applied

---
 forth/file-sysc5.4         | 59 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 lab/evolve/README.md       | 14 +++++++++
 lab/evolve/evolve.py       | 20 +++++++------
 lab/evolve/outbuf-check.py |  8 +++---
